  637                                   ; The rings hold the tune as one continuous sequence, so reaching the end of
  638                                   ; the last frame simply means the next values in them are the loop section's.
  639                                   ; The countdown follows: it reloads with the loop section's length.
  640  00000438  53AB0004                       subq.l  #1,YX6_LEFTFR(a3)
