  651                                   ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  652                                   ; YX6_stop: a0 = workspace. Hands the MFP back exactly as YX6_init found it -
  653                                   ; timers quiesced first, vectors, data, control and the four enable/mask bits
  654                                   ; restored, pendings dropped - then silences the three voices. Tone and
  655                                   ; envelope settings stay, and a fresh YX6_init starts the tune over.
  656                                   ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  657                                   YX6_stop:
